# Files Vercel must never upload/serve (audit Phase 9 — internal files in prod).
# public/ is the deploy root (vercel.json outputDirectory); these live there only
# for tooling. Backstop: vercel.json also redirects these paths to /404, and
# test/html5-config-hardening.test.mjs fails CI if public/ gains unexpected files.
#
# Cloudflare Pages / Netlify header file — kept in public/ for the header-parity
# tests (Vercel reads vercel.json, not this file).
public/_headers
# Vendoring notes for public/vendor/ (how the SRI hashes were produced).
public/vendor/README.md
# OS junk
**/.DS_Store
